{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enricher that sets every record’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to the connection the device uses when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the tracker’s worker reaches it."}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The enricher, which runs on the tracker’s worker like any other.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.network()])"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On Apple platforms the enricher starts an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NWPathMonitor"},{"type":"text","text":" of its own, which runs while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any tracker or copy holds the enricher and stops when the last lets it go: give each tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its own call. Records the worker reaches before the monitor’s first report carry no key."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Off Apple platforms there is no monitor, and the enricher sets nothing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The connection is read for each event, unlike the other standard values,